# Per-item relaunch policy for work/session-management-followups (committed).
# Overrides the root context-budget.env (default `manual`) for this work item
# only, so `scripts/session-loop.sh session-management-followups` may chain
# sessions unattended. Precedence: docs/context-budget.md -> "Relaunch knobs".
ROLLOVER_RELAUNCH=auto
